OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud across
OL,6,Fthe far west of the region but clearer
OL,7,Fin the east through the evening.
OL,8,FBecoming overcast overnight with
OL,9,Fpatchy light rain developing. Locally
OL,10,Fheavier bursts develop by dawn and
OL,11,Fbecoming persistent in the northwest.
OL,12,FMild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FOvercast with rain becoming
OL,15,Fpersistent, locally heavy or thundery
OL,16,Fwith hail and strong gusts, improving
OL,17,Fduring the early afternoon with rain
OL,18,Feasing. Cloud dissipates later with a
OL,19,Fcold night following.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
